.org","ref_id":"turn1search16","snippet":"Content Security Policy (CSP) is a computer security standard introduced to prevent cross-site scripting (XSS), clickjacking and other code injection attacks resulting from execution of","title":"Content Security Policy","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_Security_Policy"}]}}
